# DRC-MW-4: maxwidth m2 10 bend_ok via "slot" (via excluded); via covering half of a wide m2.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 20 20
paint m2
box 0 0 10 20
paint via
box 40 0 60 20
paint m2
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
